<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Paulo kwa Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya mtumbulo gha Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoseo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu kya mtumbulo kwa Timoseo hai ni lihamba ayandikili Mndumindumi Paulo kwa mvulwa ghaki Timoseo. Timoseo wa mtumbulo haki kihitabu kinguwachilwa kiyandikilwi machuva 62-64 badili gha kuwelekwa kwa Kilisito. Hai iyandikwa lipindi lya pabehi gha mwihu wa ukomu wa Mndumindumi Paulo. Paulo awelili na ughanja wa pabehi na Timoseo mbaka mihanja itangala akamkema mwana ghaki na hai inguhuma ku Wafilipi 2:22, 1Tim 1:2, 1:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hai ni imonga gha lihamba njechi kuhuma kwa Paulo akimyandikila mundu badili gha lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito. Lihamba ghangi itatu ni lihamba lya ivili lya Timoseo na Titusi na Filimoni. Timoseo wa mtumbulo ivile na malaghilo ghatangala kuilongela kutundamila hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 2:1-15, ingulongela vila vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito wangupalwa wavile na hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 3:1-13 na kukanisa ghala gha wavula wa uhwangi na hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 1:3-11, 4:1-5, 6:2-5. Hai ingulolesa vila Paulo kamvula Timoseo kuvile kilongosi paghati gha malipinga gha wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito. Timoseo wa mtumbulo ingukonganisa malaghilo yatangala yavile yanguwatanga vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito kumachuwa hagha kugholokela malipinga ghao wanguyalongosa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula kwa kumjambusa Timoseo 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumlongela Timoseo alikali mihu na wavula wa ughwangi 1:3-11.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyendelela kulongela vila ingupalwa kumshukwile Yesu Kilisito 1:12-19.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumlongela Timoseo habali gha kumtundamila Sapanga na habali zya vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito 2-3</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyomola lihamba kwa kumpegha Timoseo malaghililo gha mwihu 4-6</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Lihamba hai inguhuma kwa nenga Paulo, mndumindumi wa Kilisito Yesu kwa laghililo lya Sapanga mlokola wa twenga na Kilisito Yesu litumaini lya twenga, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />ningukuyandikila Timoseo, mwana ghangu wa chakaka kuukwinila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Ningukutakila manemu na luhungu pamonga na kukotoho kutovana kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga na Kilisito Yesu Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaniso kwa mavulo gha ughwangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Ningukuluwa ulikali haku ku Efesu, handa nikuluwili paniwelili nikiyenda ku Makedonia, ili uwesi kuwalemesa wandu wakotoho kuyendelela kuvula mavulo gha ughwangi. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Uwalongeli walekani na mahumu gha maha ng'ogha, na mavalangu gha mahina gha uwelekwa gha mambui ivile ng'ogha na mwihu, kwaikiva hagha hyogha yanguyegha masindano, hata yatimila ng'ogha mghalu wa Sapanga kweni lihengu lya Sapanga. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Lukasini lwa laghililo hali ni kuyongesa upalo hula uhuma kumoyu wa maheli, mawachilo gha maha na ukwinila wa uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Wandu waghangi wabyodoka kuhuma kwa hagha na kughalambukila malongelano gha maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Wangupala kuvile wavula wa laghililo lya Sapanga ila wangumanya ng'ogha yala wanguyalonga kwa makakala au wanguyalongela nesunesu.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Tungumanya yiwa laghililo lya Sapanga ni lya maha handa litetumilwa kwa njila gha maha. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Ila tungupalwa kumanya yiwa laghililo livikwa ng'ogha kwaikiva gha wandu wa maha, ila kwa wala wahakata na wala wayitikila ng'ogha, wamtundamila ng'ogha Sapanga na wavile na sambi, wandu wahaghulwa ng'ogha kwaikiva gha Sapanga, wandu wala waihanganya na mighalu gha mlima wogha hau, wandu wala wanguwakoma watati na nyongu ghao, au wala wakoma wandu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />wangongola, walumi wawonja na walumi wayao, wala wawakamula wandu kwa makakala na kuwahusa, wahwangi na wala wangulapa uhwangi au wala wangughola chochosi kila kivile ni kihyetu na mavulo gha uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Mavulo hagha yanguhumila na Habali Maha gha ukwilikihi wa Sapanga mweni highili, anipeghili kutangasa.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shukwile kwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Ningumshukwile Kilisito Yesu Bambu wa twenga, yula aniwesesa kughola lihengu lyaki, kwaikiva anilolile yiwa mundu mlungwana, akanihaghula kwa lihengu lyaki, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Lipindi lya dahile niwelili mundu wa kumlighu, mundu mhakila na mweni kinyengu. Ila Sapanga kaniwonela luhungu, kwaikiva niwelili nikighola hagha kwa undyungi na nivile ng'ogha na ukwinila. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Ila Bambu wa twenga kaniwonela luhungu nesu, akanipegha ukwinila na upalo kukukonganika na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Lilandu hali ni lya chakaka na lingupalwa kujumilwa, lila lingulonga yiwa: Kilisito Yesu ahikili kumlimawogha kuwalokola wala wavile na sambi. Na nenga ni mhakata nesu nipiti hagha wogha, <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />ila kwaikiva gha hagha Sapanga aniwonelili luhungu, ili kwa nenga niwelili na mahakata yapiti wogha, Kilisito Yesu apati kulangigha kufumilila kwaki kula kuwela ng'ogha na mwihu, niweli mlandanu kwa wakwinila wa kuulongolo na wapati ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Hinu Nkosi wa machuwa yayendendelela, avile ng'ogha mwihu, kawonekana ng'ogha, avile Sapanga wa weka, apeghwi utundamilwa na ukwilikihi machuwa yayendelela na machuwa yayendelela. Yinaa. <verse eid="1TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Mwana ghangu Timoseo, ningukupegha laghililo hali likikovekelana na milandu gha ulota wailongili dahile kwa wenga. Uyatumile handa mgogha ili upati kutovana ngondo kwa umaha kwa kuitetela Habali Maha, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />ukiva na ukwinila pamonga na mawachilo ghamaha. Waghangi walekili mawachilo hagha nagha wakaleka kumkwinila Sapanga. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Paghati gha weni ni Humenayo pamonga na Alekisanda wavile nimpegha Lihyukana, ili walivuli waleki kumlighu Sapanga.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Mayupo gha lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kiilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Pambila gha hyogha, ninguwaluwa nesu mumluwi Sapanga kwaikiva gha vila wanguvipala, mumyupi Sapanga, na muwayupili wandu waghangi na kumshukwile Sapanga hagha yagholwe kwaikiva gha wandu wogha, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Kwaikiva gha wankosi na wakulu wogha ili tupati kulikala kwa kuponga na kukotoho kuwela na maghaso kungalilu gha kumtundamila Sapanga na ndyangilu maha. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Mghalu hau wa maha na ungujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga mlokola wa twenga, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />yula kangupala wandu wogha walokolwi na wapati kuumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Avile Mundu mmonga mghola ndulumu paghati gha Sapanga na wandu, Mundu hayu ni Kilisito Yesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />yula kajihumisa mweni kuwalokola wandu wogha. Hau uwelili uhighiliso lipindi lipalilwi palihikili, yiwa Sapanga angupala kuwalokola wandu wogha. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Na nenga nihaghuliwa nivile mtangasa na mndumindumi, ningulonga uchakaka na ng'ogha ughwangi ili kuwavula wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wapati kumkwinila Sapanga na kuumanya uchakaka,<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Hinaa kila mahala ningupala walumi wangughola yala angupala Sapanga wayupi wakiva wayinula mawoko yaghululwa kala wakotoho kuwela na lilaka hilahila wakotoho watatala. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Hilahila ningupala wadala wavali kwa utundamilu na waweli ndyangilu maha, ng'ogha kwa mitindu gha kuluka hwila, kulilemba kwa zahabu, au lulu au nguu zya mapesa ngoo, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Ila kulipamba kwa weni kungupalwa kuvile kwa matendu gha maha handa ingupalwa kwa wadala wayitikila kumkwinila Sapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Wadala wangupalwa kulikala jii na kuhyoghanila lipindi lya kujivula. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Nenga nimleka ng'ogha mdala avuli au kumlongosa mlumi, hinu alikali jii hela. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Kwaikiva Adamu alumbilwi mtumbulo na kuulongolo Eva, <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />na ng'ogha Adamu angongilwi ila ni mdala ndiwa angongilwi akaghola sambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Hata nagha mdala atelokolwa kwa kulela kwaki ikiva ateyendelela kulikala kuukwinila, upalo na waweli ku mhaghulo wa Sapanga, pamonga na kuwela na kujilongosa mweni.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Kilongosi kulipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Milando hai ni chakaka, ikiva mundu angupala kulongosa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito, hayu angupala lihengu lya maha. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Kilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito angupalwa aweli mundu wakulongelwa ng'ogha mahakata aweli na mdala mmonga, aweli mweni kujilongosa mweni, mweni kutundamilwa, mpala wahenja na anguwesa kuvula, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Akotoho kuwela mlowela, avile ng'ogha na maghombi ila aweli kapola, na awelili ng'ogha mundu wa kupala mapesa. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Angupalwa aweli mweni kuwesa kulongosa na kuigholokela lighuta lyaki kwa umaheli na kuhighilisa yiwa wana ghaki wangumuyitikila na wanguwela na utundamilu kwa njila zyogha. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Kwaikiva ikiva mundu kamanya ng'ogha vila ingumpala agholokeli lighuta lyaki mweni, ghuli atewesa kuligholokela lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Akotoho kuwela mundu kamkwinila Kilisito machuwa gha papehi, akotoho akaidumbila na akagua ku ulamula handa alamulilwi Lihyukana. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Ingumpala aweli mundu wa kuwoneka maha kwa wandu wavile ng'ogha wa lipinga lya wandu wavile ng'ogha wandu wa Kilisito, ili akotoho pughanywa na kuwomela kumtegho wa Lihyukana.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumikila wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Vilavila watumikila kulipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito wangupalwa wavile wandu wa kutundamilwa na wa mbindingu, wakotoho kuwela walowela, ng'ogha weni lumatamata lwa mapesa. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Inguwapala kukovekela mavulo gha uchakaka gha ukwinila na mawachilo gha maheli. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Wangupalwa wayeswi huti, pawawoneka yiwa wavile ng'ogha na mahakata hinu wagholi lihengu hali. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Wadala wa wandu hagha wangupalwa waweli weni kutundamilwa na wabaisila ng'ogha ila weni kujilongosa, weni kujumilwa kukila mghalu. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Mtumikila kulipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila kilisito ingumpala avile na mdala mmonga, na mweni kuwesa kulongosa maha wana ghaki na wandu wogha wawelili ku ukaya ghaki. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Watumikila wala wangutumikila maha kulihengu lyao wangupokela utundamilu na wanguwesa kulongela ukwinila ghao ku Kilisito Yesu ng'ogha holu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchakaka mkulungwa uhighilwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Pamonga na yiwa nipala kuhika kwa wenga, ningukuyandikila malaghililo hagha, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />ili paniwesa ng'ogha kuhika kwa kuloposela upati kumanya vila wangupalwa wandu kutama kulighuta lya Sapanga avile mkomu, livile ndiwa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito, livile mghomba na kitamilo kya chakaka. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Kwa chakaka uhighu gha mighalu gha Sapanga ihighwa ni kulungwa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">awonikanili kunjimba handa mundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akahighiliswa na Mpumulo yiwa ni mlungwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akawoneka na mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">atangasiliwi ku milima hyogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akajumilwa kumlimawogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akatolwa kunani kuukwilikihi.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Wavula wa uhwangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga angulonga lipalalipala yiwa machuwa gha kuulongolo wandu ghangi wateleka ukwinila na kuyitikila mpumulo wa ughwangi na kukovekela mavulo gha mahyukana. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Mavulo gha nagha yangulandalwa na wandu wavile wambindingu wala wangulongela uhwangi, wavile lukani lwao luhova. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Wandu hagha wanguwakanisa wandu wakotoho kuposa na kuwalaghila wakotoho kulyegha amonga gha mulyo, mulyo hula Sapanga aulumbili ili upokelwi kwa kushukwile na wandu wogha wamkwinila na kuumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Kwaikiva kila kindu alumbili Sapanga ni maha, kwahela kindu chochosi kya kukanilwa ikiva kipokelwa kwa kushukwile, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />kwaikiva vighululwa kupitila kwa lilando lya Sapanga na kwa mayupo.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumikila wa maha wa Kilisito Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ikiva utewapegha malaghilo hagha wamkwinila Kilisito Yesu, utevile mtumikila wa maha wa Kilisito Yesu, ulelelilwi na milando gha uchakaka gha ukwinila na ghala mavulo maheli uyakovekelili. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Ila ulekani na luhumu lula lumuyinula ng'ogha Sapanga na lwa maha ng'ogha. Na uzyoweleli kulikala handa angupala Sapanga. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Kwaikiva mavulo gha kuchenga higha yavile na hupo ghaki, Ila kulikala vila angupala Sapanga kuvile na hupo kumighalu hyogha, kwaikiva yangutupegha litumaini lya ukomu wa hinaa na wakuulongolu. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Lilandu hali ni lya uchakaka, kangi lingupalwa kupokelwa kwa miwoku miivili nesu. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Twenga tunguyangala kughola lihengu nesu, kwaikiva tulivika litumaini kwa Sapanga avile na ukomu, mlokola wa wandu wogha nesu nesu wala wamkwinila.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ila uwapeghi malaghilo na mavulo hagha. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Ukotoho kujumila mundu yoyosi akupughanyi kwaikiva wenga ni msongolo, ila uweli mlandano kwa wala wangumkwinila Kilisito; kwa vila ungulongela, ndyangilu ghako, upalo, ukwinila na ngalilu maheli. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Utumili lipindi lyako na uyangalai ghako kusoma paluagha Mayandiko, kutangasa na kuvula, mbaka panitehika. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Ukotoho kuleka kutumila uweso ghako wa weka hula upeghilwi na Sapanga kupitila milando gha walota wa Sapanga, pauvikilwa mawoko na wagogolo. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Uweli na kuyangala kumighalu hagha na uyagholi ili kila mundu aloli vila unguyendelela maha. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Uligholokeli wenga umweni na kulola mavulo ghako, na uyendeleli kughola hagha. Kwaikiva paughola nagha utejilokola umweni pamonga na wala wangukuyoghanila.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Vila gha kulikala na wakwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Ukotoho kumkalipila mgogolo ila ulongeli na mweni handa tati. Ulongeli na wasongolo wa kilumi handa walongo ghako, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Wadala wagogolo wagholeli handa wanyongo ghako hilahila na wadala wasongolo wagholeli handa wahacha ghako kwa utundamilu wogha.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Uwaviki maha wadala wahoviliwi na walumi ghao na wavile ng'ogha na yeyosi wa kuwatanga kwa kuwatanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Ila mdala ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki yula avile na wana au wahukulu, hagha wana au wahukulu wangupalwa wajivuli kughola lihengu lyao lya kumtundamila Sapanga kumatendu kwa walongu ghao ili wawahuyisilile walela ghao na wagogolo ghao kwaikiva hau ni mghalu ungumuhekelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Mdala ahovitiliwi na mlumi chakaka, ingumaanisa yula ahighalile weka yaki huvika ukwinila ghaki kwa Sapanga na mweni hulikala nesu kwa kuyupa uhiku na pamuhi akimyupa Sapanga ili amtangi. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ila yula mdala ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki na angulikala kwa kuyananga mapesa hayu kahova kala. Pamonga na anguwoneka yiwa mkomu. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Uwapeghi wandu malaghilo hagha hilahila, ili pakotoho kuwela na mundu yoyosi wa kuwalalamikila. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ikiva mundu anguwagholokela ng'ogha walongu ghaki, nesu nesu wala wa ukaya ghaki mweni, hayu kakanila ukwinila, na kangi ni mhakata apiti yula kakwinila ng'ogha.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Mdala yoyosi ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki akotoho kuvikwa kumvalangu wa wahovitiliwi mbaka mdala hayu atimili machuva isitini. Kangi awelili kaposwa lihanja limonga hela, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Na avile angumanyika kwa matendu maha, avile kawalela wana ghaki maheli, avile anguwapokela wahenja, awaghululile maghulu wandu wa Sapanga, yula awatangili wandu wavile na lung'ai, na mweni kulihumisa kughola yala hyogha maheli. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Ukotoho kuwayandikisa wadala wahongolo wahovitiliwi na walumi ghao, kwaikiva lumatamata lwao lwa higha paliyongoseka kupiti kujihumisa kughola lihengu lya Kilisito, watepala kuposwa kangi, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />na weni watelamulwa handa vila walongelili kula mtumbulo yiwa watemtumikila Sapanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Na kupiti hagha, wadala wahovitiliwi na walumi handa hagha wangujivula kuwela waleli na wakitindila tindila lighuta kwa lighuta na wanguwela ng'ogha waleli weka ila hata kuwela wandu wa kusongesela kwa kulonga milando iwapala ng'ogha kulonga. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Hinu ningalipala wadala wahongolo wahovitiliwi na walumi ghao waposwi, wapati wana na wagholokeli lighuta ili wakotoho kuwapegha wahakata wa twenga njila gha kutulongela mighalu mihakata. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Kwaikiva wadala waghangi wahovitiliwi na walumi ghao wahyuka kala na kumkovekela Lihyukana. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ila ikiva mdala mkwinila Kilisito kawela na wadala wahovilwa na walumi ghao ingumpala awatangi akotoho kuwalekela lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito mhighu hau, ili lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito liwesi kuwatanga wala wadala wahovitili na walumi wavile ng'ogha na mtanga.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Wala vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila kilisito walongosa wandu maha wangupalwa kupokela utundamilu nesu, nesu nesu wala wanguyangala kukutangasa na kukuvula. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Kwaikiva mayandiko yangulonga, “Ukotoho kumuwopa ng'ombi mlomo paapukutula mapemba", na kangi mayandiko yangulonga, "mghola lihengu angupalwa apokeli msahala ghaki.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Ukotoho kujumila masitaka gha wagogolo yayeghwa kwa wenga ila mbaka paweli na wandu waivili au waitatu wailolile kwa mihu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Wala wanguyendelela kughola mahakata wakanilwi paluagha, ili wandu waghangi wawesi kutila.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ningukulaghila kuulongolo gha Sapanga, kuulongolo gha Kilisito Yesu na kuulongolo gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wala wahaghulwa na Sapanga, uyagholi malaghilo hagha na ukotoho kuleka hata limonga, na ukotoho kupala kumgholela mmonga nesu na ghangi isokombi kukila ukighola. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Ukotoho kughola kwa kuloposela kumhaghula mundu yoyosi kughola lihengu lya Bambu kwa kumvikila mawoko hata Ukotoho kukongine sambi zya waghangi ila uihighilisili kukotoho kughola sambi.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Kwaikiva gha uvina na mtima wa wenga ukotoho kunywegha masi hela ila unyweghi na divai mayaghani iwesi kukutanga.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Sambi zya wandu waghangi zinguwoneka paluagha, na sambi hasi zinguwalongola kuulamula, ila sambi zya wandu waghangi zitewoneka kuulongolo. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Hilahila matendu gha maha yavile paluagha, na hata ghala ghamaha ng'ogha yawesa ng'ogha kuhighwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Wahusutu wogha wangupalwa kuwatundamila wakulu ghao ili lihina lya Sapanga likotoho kulighwa hata mavulo gha twenga yakotoho kupughanyika. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Wala wahusutu wavile na wakulu ghao ni wakilisito wangupalwa ng'ogha kupungula utundamilu kwaikiva weni ni wakwinila wayao, na badili ghaki wangupalwa wawatumikili maha nesu, kwaikiva hagha wangulinoma na mghalu hau ni wala wakwinila, wavile ni wapalwa ghao.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Mavulo gha uhwangi na UTAJILI wa uchakaka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Uwavuli na kuwatangasila mighalu hagha. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ikiva mundu yoyosi atevula mavulo kihyetu na mavulo hagha na yula kajumila ng'ogha na mavulo gha uchakaka gha Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito gha kuwatanga wandu walikali vila angupala Sapanga, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />hayu angulongoswa na likwinakwina na hata angumanya ng'ogha chochosi. Ni mundu wa kupala masindano na utatala kumilando hela, na hai inguyegha wifu, ukologhanyu, malighu, mawachilo mahakata, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />na malongelano yavile ng'ogha na mwihu paghati gha wandu wavile luhala lwao liwachila mahakata, weni kuliwachila yiwa lihengu lya kuvula habali gha Sapanga ni njila gha kuipatila hupo. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Kulikala vila angupala Sapanga kungumghola mundu aweli mundu wa hindu ngoo, ikiva angubaka na hindu ghaki avikola. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Kwaikiva tuhika ng'ogha na vindu vyovyosi kumlimawogha, na tutetola ng'ogha vindu vyovyosi patuhuka. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Hinu ikiva tuvile na mulyo au nguu, tungupalwa tubakwi na vyeni. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Ila wala wangupala kuwela na hindu itangala wangugua kumayeso na watewomelwa na mtegho wa lumatamata lutangala lwa kisiisii, lula lweni kuyegha mahakilo, lula lunguwakwegha wandu mbaka kumkologhanyo na kumayalamiso. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Kwaikiva kupala nesu mapesa ni mtumbulo wa uhakata wogha. Wandu waghangi wapalili kupokela mapesa hata wakaleka ukwinila, na kujihoma weni kwa maghaso yatangala.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo kwa Timoseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ila wenga mundu wa Sapanga ulekani na mighalu hai hyogha. Uyangalayi kughola vila ingupalwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, ulikali vila angupala Sapanga, ukwinila, upalo, ulindila na unyalinyali. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Utovani ngondo maha gha ukwinila, ukoli ukomu hula wa machuwa yayendelela ukemililwi pala pauyitikila ukwinila ghako kuulongolo gha wandu watangala. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Nikiwela kuulongolo gha Sapanga yula anguvipegha vindu vyogha ukomu, na kuulongolo gha Kilisito Yesu yula ailongile uchakaka kuulongolo gha kilongosi Ponitio Pilato ningukulaghila, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ukoli malaghilo ghako na kuyaghola kwa ulungwana mbaka lichuwa lila paatehumila Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />yula avile Sapanga atemyegha kwa lipindi lya Sapanga lijumilwa, mweni kutundamilwa, avile weka ghaki kilongosi, Nkosi wa wankosi na Bambu wa mabambu. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Mweni weka ghaki angulama machuwa yayendelela, avile angulikala kumhana uwesa ng'ogha kuhikilwa pabei, kwahela mundu awesili kumlola au anguwesa kumlola hinaa. Utundamilu na makakala uvile kwa mweni machuwa yayendelela. Yinaa. <verse eid="1TI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Walaghili wandu wavile na hindu ngoo kumachuwa hagha, wakotoho kuidumbadumba na wakotoho kuvika ukwinila ghao kuhindu ilikala kwa lipindi mayaghani, ila wamkwinili Sapanga, yula avile kwa ulungwana ghaki hutupegha hindu vyogha tutumili kwa kuhekelela. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Walaghili wagholi mighalu gha maha, wavile wandu wa hindu ngoo kwa kughola ghamaha, na wavile wandu walungwana na waliyandali kuwapegha waghangi hindu ghao. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Kwa kughola nagha watevile wajivikila ngoko na hai itevile kitamilo kya maha kwaikiva gha lipindi lya luulongolo. Na baha watevile wajipatila ukomu hula wa chakaka.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoseo, ugholokeli yala hyogha wakupeghili. Ulikali mihu na malongelano yamhekelesa ng'ogha Sapanga na utatala wa kisiisii kwa ghala wandu waghangi wanguyakema “Mavulo.” <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Kwaikiva waghangi wajidumbilila kuwela na hagha mavulo na kumwihu ghaki wakayalamisa ukwinila ghao.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Ninguwatakila mwenga wogha manemu gha Bambu iweli pamonga na mwenga.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>